ick Links dropdown anchored under its button, and a responsive header with the mobile audience grid + Quick Links button.\n- **`src/data/site.ts`** — added observed `quickLinks`.\n- **`src/pages/MorePages.tsx`** — Search page/field matched to the reference.\n- **`src/components/Footer.tsx`** — campus row no longer wraps.\n- **`src/vite-env.d.ts`** (new) — clean `tsc --noEmit` (exit 0).\n\n## Verification\n- `npm install && npm run build` succeed; dist inlined to a single self-contained `output/index.html` (all 58 images as data-URIs, fonts embedded) — no external requests.\n- Console: **0 errors, 0 warnings** on the delivered build.\n- Internal navigation verified by click-through (main menu → Giving/Academics/Initiatives, footer Contact, 404 links → offline page); all 20 routes render; compared against the reference at 1920×1080 and 375×812 (header, footer, Quick Links, mobile Main Menu, offline page).\n- Binary media reused from the loopback origin only; no reference class names or DOM serialization in source.\n\nDeliverables: source in `/workspace/recreation/src`, built single-file `/workspace/recreation/output/index.html`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1902446,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f294820-3d93-47f5-9a04-120fee6677b4","uuid":"2f60cc68-655c-41ec-9f41-90ae36e1608d"}
